6551\uff1aCPR+AED MR\u8a13\u7df4\uff08\u7f8e\u570b\u7248\uff09.png", "id": "1533829641854735", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499627044_1533829645188068_4442039244239323422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ash9OBOKGFIQ7kNvwG47ZSb&_nc_oc=AdqKdJ47zm403DPq4ofYDC77Xs7py_hIZQpxJnmD74c7wBn6Kty_qSHCpHLkYMBQniA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzlP1mzMpQ6voAN1QW8XvfJL_U8QDSCeHn4twCBl2UYg&oe=6AF0810E"}, "display_name": "(US) Heartbeat Rescue: CPR+AED MR", "keywords": ["CPR", "AED", "training", "emergency", "resuscitation"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udfc6 2025 SIIF Award Winner \u2013 KFI Special Award\n\n**(US) Heartbeat Rescue: CPR+AED MR \u2013 Advanced Training System**\n\n\u3010Physical Touch \u00d7 Virtual Pressure\u3011\n\nTrain with real CPR manikins in immersive MR emergency scenarios including campuses, roadside accidents, and vehicle crashes. Real-time overlays and instant feedback help build accurate rescue muscle memory.\n\n**\ud83d\udccd IMPORTANT: CHOOSE YOUR BUILD**\n\n* \ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\uddfc Traditional Chinese: https://www.meta.com/experiences/24070258989326707\n* \ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5 Japanese: https://www.meta.com/experiences/30473230512291284\n* \ud83c\uddf0\ud83c\uddf7 Korean: https://www.meta.com/experiences/24207430705609388\n* \ud83c\udf0e Global English: https://www.meta.com/experiences/24613790758228362\n\n**Professional Features:**\n\n* Scenario-Based MR rescue training\n* Real-time MR manikin synchronization\n* 3-Color CPR feedback system\n* 13-Step AI performance assessment\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Start your 7-Day FREE Trial today!\n\n**B2B & Institutional Solutions:**\n\n* Student score dashboard export\n* Training performance analytics\n* MDM-ready deployment support\n\n\ud83c\udf10 Web: https://www.huaging.com/en/contact\n\n\u2709\ufe0f Email: huaging@gmail.com", "short_description": "(US) Heartbeat Rescue: CPR+AED MR \u2013 Advanced Training System\n\n\u3010Physical Touch \u00d7 Virtual Pressure: Master Rescue in 30s\u3011\n\nTraditional training lacks realism. Our MR (Mixed Reality) system merges physical manikins with high-stress scenarios (Campus, Car Crash, Roadside), delivering real-time overlays and instant feedback to build true muscle memory.\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Start your 7-Day FREE Trial & unlock your rescue report!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.huaging.com/en/pages/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HUAGING Digital Technology", "support_website_url": "https://www.huaging.com/en/contact", "website_url": "https://www.huaging.com/en/products/cpr-aed-mr-immersive-training", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_TW", "ja", "vi", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es_PE", "ko", "id"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29546048795002509"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823876_734157985873062_1268057485205363464_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=528dmDQH5YkQ7kNvwEVISg1&_nc_oc=Adq263rlpkgbVA9RqDiQ4Hg6uM9Czl8-aR1TUbowyqlmeBI_AxwpPDmYuRRmj7N_thM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSAyUqn5FAKnAmAUKluKW9CYT35ww0x6uk8m3S6UGzIGA&oe=6AF08DE0"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer